"         ELAXIAN'S QUEST"
" "
"       Shadow of Etheros"
" ",2
"",0
"",0
"2"
"In the Fourth Age, peace on the"
"Southeastern Coast had grown steady"
"and hard."
"The dark memories of war had come"
"to fade away, like a memory."
" ",3
"",0
"",0
"3"
"But Darkness once again reaches out"
"its hand, rising from the deep pits"
"of the earth to remind us who"
"truly rules the night..."
" "
" ",4
"",0
"",0
"4"
"You are Elaxian, living in the"
"rough harbor slums of Thunder Bay."
"The citizens here used to live in"
"relative peace and harmony, until..."
" "
" ",5
"",0
"",0
"5"
" "
"The sixth month, in the year of Valera."
"The sea turned fowl, and the ground"
"began to tremble."
" "
" ",6
"",0
"",0
"6"
"   --- Prophecy of Shadow ---   "
"Hush... hush... the black wind sighs."
"Doom... doom... beneath dark skies."
"Why does the sun grow dim and cold"
"On a day once bright and bold?"
" ",7
"",0
"",0
"7"
"Because Etheros walks once more."
"The Lich-Lord of Forgotten Ages"
"has shattered his eternal chains."
"Were I still flesh, I would flee"
"before the heavens cease to be..."
" ",8
"",0
"",0
"8"
" "
"You have read the old prophecies,"
"you have heard the sailors' tales"
"and probably dismissed them. But what"
"you don't know is that it's all true..."
" ",9
"",0
"",0
"9"
"Etheros, Master of the Dead, is"
"not gone. He slumbers no longer."
"His eyes have opened wide in the"
"Rift of Shadows, and his cultists"
"have already begun to march..."
" "
" ",10
"",0
"",0
"10"
"Thunder Bay, your hometown, is"
"threatened by the shadow of the Lich."
"So for You, Elaxian, the time has"
"come. The adventure must start,"
"before the dark consumes all..."
